Alpine.js — CSP build (@alpinejs/csp)
Vendored version: 3.15.12
Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/@alpinejs/csp/-/csp-3.15.12.tgz (dist/cdn.min.js)
SHA-256 (alpine-csp.min.js): 566167134bb2347110904e2ced6e816d2e8d837200c158f98b72372b3bb0b9a6

This is the eval-free "CSP" build of Alpine.js: it interprets directive
expressions with a hand-written tokenizer + AST walker instead of
new Function()/eval, so it runs under a strict Content-Security-Policy with
no 'unsafe-eval'. Governed by ADR-0136.

